633	  // The schedule board (#1115): read as the watermark, rewritten only when a
634	  // row changes. An unreadable listing reads as absent — evaluate fail-open —
635	  // and additionally forbids the write: never write what you could not read,
636	  // or a transient read failure mints a second board.
